# Secrets — NEVER commit these.
# entropy.bin is a per-installation 64-byte seed for Wolfram's DRBG. A shared
# seed would give every console identical key material, so it must not reach
# the repository. See src/util/entropy.h and AGENTS.md §13.
entropy.bin
*.entropy
session.dat
device.key

# Fetched at build time by tools/fetch_cacert.sh, not committed: the Mozilla
# set expires, and a stale bundle in git fails on console in a way that reads
# as a network bug. `make cacert` refreshes it.
romfs/cacert.pem

